NAME        KIND         VERSION  MAY USE
future-kit  installable  1.0.0    not loaded: kind = "future": "core", "installable" or "addon"
pair-kit    installable  1.1.0    speak
The skills here give the model 1 function (fixture_package). A session takes 32, the voice's own and the actions part's first (30 on a product lamp), and past 32 the last are dropped unless the voice runs with LAMP_USE_SKILL=on (every skill through one function, use_skill).
